        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in combined cycle plant, best technology</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in combined cycle plant, best technology
PSI data (BFE project 407, Christian Bauer, April 2012).;
Synonyms: GuD, GCC, /NGCC; 
UUID: 4f7b45a5-dbc5-3abe-8582-f16fb629566c
The module includes fuel input from high pressure (RER) network, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Best technology
Time period: Emission data partly from old references
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, operator information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4f7b45a5-dbc5-3abe-8582-f16fb629566c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
